  "prompt": "用于水平平地安装的独立深橡木安全栏杆，6米长、1.45米高、0.24米厚。采用粗壮方形端柱和中柱、密集竖向栏杆、底部横梁与连续厚实顶扶手，底部带方形木质安装脚座，结构完整稳固，不能悬空。风格、柱径、间距和扶手截面必须与配套深橡木楼梯栏杆一致。主色严格使用#52362E，受光边缘与木纹可使用#714D48和#8E664D；任何普通材质颜色只能使用#52362E、#714D48、#8E664D。无墙体、无地面、无背景、无附加装饰。模型局部Y轴向上，长度沿局部X轴，局部Z正方向为正面。\nCoordinate contract: local Y+ is up, local Z+ is the front, entrance, or forward direction, and local X+ is right. Put doors, facades, openings, windshields, noses, seats, and other recognizable front details toward local Z+. For a modular repeated element, explicitly choose the long axis: side-by-side modules span local X with depth/front on local Z; traversal modules span local Z. Keep the model centered at its origin.\nCanonical dimensions contract: width=6, height=1.45, depth=0.24 world units. Keep the generated mesh within this centered bounding size.",
